    {
      "subId": "1001005",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Klee",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "100100501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "100100501": {
            "id": "100100501",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Alright, that's the Hilichurls and barriers all taken care of...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100502"
            ]
          },
          "100100502": {
            "id": "100100502",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And we didn't set the forest on fire.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100503"
            ]
          },
          "100100503": {
            "id": "100100503",
            "speakerId": 10090,
            "speakerName": "Klee",
            "text": "I was extra careful with Jumpy Dumpty!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100504"
            ]
          },
          "100100504": {
            "id": "100100504",
            "speakerId": 10090,
            "speakerName": "Klee",
            "text": "I've been getting sent to confinement less and less these days!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100505"
            ]
          },
          "100100505": {
            "id": "100100505",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Nice job, Klee!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100506"
            ]
          },
          "100100506": {
            "id": "100100506",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Maybe sometime soon, you won't have to go at all...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100507"
            ]
          },
          "100100507": {
            "id": "100100507",
            "speakerId": 10090,
            "speakerName": "Klee",
            "text": "Well, if Master Jean would just let Klee blow the confinement room up...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100508"
            ]
          },
          "100100508": {
            "id": "100100508",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's not really what Paimon had in mind... Wait, what about the trial? Did we learn anything new?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100509"
            ]
          },
          "100100509": {
            "id": "100100509",
            "speakerId": 10090,
            "speakerName": "Klee",
            "text": "Yep! I found this in the hole Jumpy Dumpty created after exploding...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100510"
            ]
          },
          "100100510": {
            "id": "100100510",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh, another note.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100511"
            ]
          },
          "100100511": {
            "id": "100100511",
            "speakerId": 10090,
            "speakerName": "Klee",
            "text": "Yup, and it's mom's handwriting again...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100512"
            ]
          },
          "100100512": {
            "id": "100100512",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Now then, Dodoco may or may not have blasted all the hurdles away — though the most direct approach is sometimes the most elegant one. Either way, thus did Dodoco make it to the second stage of the trial...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100513"
            ]
          },
          "100100513": {
            "id": "100100513",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Which, coincidentally, was also the final stage. Even the most energetic of children need to pace themselves, after all. So...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100514"
            ]
          },
          "100100514": {
            "id": "100100514",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Dodoco proceeded to the banks of a lake of fallen stars, passed the final trial, and obtained her reward. But could things really be that simple...?\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100515"
            ]
          },
          "100100515": {
            "id": "100100515",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh, \"a lake of fallen stars\"... That must be Starfell Lake!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100516"
            ]
          },
          "100100516": {
            "id": "100100516",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let's go see what we can find.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100517"
            ]
          },
          "100100517": {
            "id": "100100517",
            "speakerId": 10090,
            "speakerName": "Klee",
            "text": "Alright!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100518"
            ]
          },
          "100100518": {
            "id": "100100518",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon's super curious about what this reward's gonna be. Fingers crossed for some kind of awesome treasure!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1001006",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the Starfell Lake",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "100100601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "100100601": {
            "id": "100100601",
            "speakerId": 10090,
            "speakerName": "Klee",
            "text": "Oooh, it's a chest!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100602"
            ]
          },
          "100100602": {
            "id": "100100602",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The final treasure must be inside this thing...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100603"
            ]
          },
          "100100603": {
            "id": "100100603",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Klee, would you do honors...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100604"
            ]
          },
          "100100604": {
            "id": "100100604",
            "speakerId": 10090,
            "speakerName": "Klee",
            "text": "You got it! Me and Dodoco will get it open, no problem!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100605"
            ]
          },
          "100100605": {
            "id": "100100605",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa, wait a second... Monsters incoming!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100606"
            ]
          },
          "100100606": {
            "id": "100100606",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Guess it's not going to be that simple, after all...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100607"
            ]
          },
          "100100607": {
            "id": "100100607",
            "speakerId": 10090,
            "speakerName": "Klee",
            "text": "Hmph, they wanna steal Dodoco's treasure, I just know it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100100608"
            ]
          },
          "100100608": {
            "id": "100100608",
            "speakerId": 10090,
            "speakerName": "Klee",
            "text": "Let's kick 'em out. Then, we can open the box!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1001009",
